<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4418"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tucker<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tucker<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 21, 2005 - 1:19 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->&#40;My first post on catchbtk.com&#41; <BR>Tom, <BR>Do you think BTK will kill again?  Why/Why Not? <BR> <BR>I have followed this case very closely, and have become very fascinated by it...Although I was not alive when BTK did the majority of his killings, for the last couple years I have studied the BTK case and very closely, even writing a few college papers on the it.  This is a great site, and I hope that it can lead to the capture of BTK &#40;just a little background on me&#41;.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
