<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4431"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Iq<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Iq<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 21, 2005 - 5:28 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hi Tom- <BR> <BR>Sounds like you had a great trip. I am eager for you to post all that you&#39;ve learned. I truly hope you still feel the same about sharing all the information on your website, as you said in your &#34;paging sherlock holmes&#34; article. <BR> <BR>The one I look forward to the most is the &#34;signature&#34;. Although you said it was a big let down. Anything that will give the people that have followed the case so closely more insight into the &#34;Real BTK&#34;. <BR> <BR>-iq<!--/Text--></td></tr>
