<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4607"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Wade<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wade<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 24, 2005 - 8:44 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Devbost- <BR>BTK used the ice in the ice trays to make his hands cold.  He liked the thought of the &#34;shocking&#34; feeling the victims would get when he put his cold hands on the victims throats.  Sorry so crude, but this is why the ice trays were mentioned.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
