<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4687"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Scbenson2001<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Scbenson2001<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->6-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 25, 2005 - 10:27 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom, <BR>love the letter section. The new full otero letter is great. Do you know who Btk is refering to when he says &#34;pantyhose killer of florida&#34;. I find it strange he says that when the rest of the cases he talks about are so well known. I&#39;m pretty well versed on serial killers and have no idea what case he&#39;s talking about <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
