<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4759"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lorenap<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lorenap<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 25, 2005 - 9:39 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom, with the flurry of activity today surrounding the latest btk drop and potentially another one out there somewhere, are you tempted to make a return trip here to Wichita? <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4759-->
<!--Post: 4761--><!--Time: 1106722154-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4761"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:webmaster@catchbtk.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Tom_voigt<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tom_voigt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 25, 2005 - 10:49 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Lanena: I just don&#39;t have info about the DNA that I consider to be 100% accurate. <BR> <BR>Beck: The knots used on Bright were apparently the same as used at Otero scene. <BR> <BR>Everyone: The assumption is BTK used ice during the commission of his crimes. The trays were definitely out of place. <BR> <BR>Catcher: Please adjust your attitude or don&#39;t post anymore here. <BR> <BR>Scbenson: I haven&#39;t researched that yet. <BR> <BR>Skov: Don&#39;t know if that info is accurate. Also, I don&#39;t know much about the psychic aside from what was mentioned in the newspaper articles. <BR> <BR>Lorenap: I&#39;ll come back to Wichita as soon as I can afford it, hopefully soon.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4761-->
<!--Post: 4763--><!--Time: 1106723670-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4763"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Skov<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Skov<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 25, 2005 - 11:14 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->SORRY CATCHER! <BR> Of course it was you, I guess the new BTK drop yesterday took a bite of my concentration <BR> <BR>skov<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4763-->
<!--Post: 4818--><!--Time: 1106764086-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4818"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:Iwillc@tchu.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Catcher<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Catcher<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 10:28 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom, <BR>I just reread my post and objectively noticed that it could be interpretated as me being sarcastic to you.  I&#39;m totally not trying to be that way!  I appreciate everything you are doing here, and I was under the impression at the time that KSN covered your site in a way that undermined its content.  I then recanted when I noticed you had released the &#34;world premiere&#34;.  I&#39;m just passionate about this hunt, as you are, and I will take care to not imply sarcastic tones next time.  Hope you can answer soon, take care.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4818-->
<!--Post: 4833--><!--Time: 1106768515-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4833"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tippy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tippy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 11:41 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom - thanks for clarifying the ice thing.   <BR> <BR>One question. <BR> <BR>It seems BTK may have been leaving a message for you - since your birthday was the same date as the date mentioned on his card.  <BR> <BR>Would you be open to being a liason, of sorts, between him and the PD?  If that is his intent?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4833-->
<!--Post: 4846--><!--Time: 1106770217-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4846"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:hackenmaster@yahoo.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Wichitan<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wichitan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 12:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom hope you enjoyed wichita, sorry i didnt get by to see you, damn ice.  I got a couple of angles here, first the drop offs, they seem to be leading to a trail, and maybe number 7 would be directly in line with number 6 and number 8.  Second I think that if takes credits for anymore murders then they will be that of the 3 park city women, even and including carol moulde. Wouldnt that be shocking? <BR> <BR>wichitan <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4846-->
<!--Post: 5040--><!--Time: 1106855419-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5040"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Marga<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Marga<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 27, 2005 - 11:50 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom - Can you tell us what you mean by &#34;Not nice to mess with Charlie...&#34; ? <BR> <BR>Marga<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5040-->
<!--Post: 5109--><!--Time: 1106874354-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5109"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Cougar<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Cougar<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 27, 2005 - 5:05 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hi Tom, <BR> <BR> <BR>1. How does it feel to have posted here on your site, your birthday and your itinerary for your Wichita trip, only to have the two latest communications dropped on those very days?  <BR> <BR>2. Is there pressure on you from LE over your publishing of the &#40;almost&#41; complete Otero letter?  <BR> <BR>3. Do you think/know that LE is keeping known facts of other BTK victims out of the media to avoid a citywide panic?  <BR> <BR>4. Is there any productive way that citizens of Wichita can request and recieve answers in regards to coldcase DNA being tested against BTK DNA?  <BR> <BR>Thanks. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5109-->
<!--Post: 5129--><!--Time: 1106888427-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5129"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->George<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->George<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 27, 2005 - 9:00 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom, considering the newcomers, would it be a good idea to post maybe two or three paragraphs about how two BTK boards and your Z site &#40;because of Mr. X&#41; have <i>a lot</i> of people with agendas looking to get you? I&#39;m pretty sure I&#39;ve seen two so far, including one who claims BTK was female.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5129-->
<!--Post: 5165--><!--Time: 1106932696-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5165"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 28, 2005 - 9:18 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hi Tom - first of all I would like to thank-you for all the information you give to us.  I know you have much more but that your hands must surely be tied in regard to certain items due to agreements with LE.  I was hoping that somehow you could post the words of Charlie to BTK... I donnot have audio capabilities on my computor and I would really like to hear &#34;see&#34; his words.  Thanks again for your site, the pics and the info.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5165-->
<!--Post: 5438--><!--Time: 1107119873-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5438"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Brazilian<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Brazilian<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 1:17 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hey Tom, did BTK communicate to Charlie Otero?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5438-->
<!--Post: 5459--><!--Time: 1107136423-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5459"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Pax56<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Pax56<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, January 30, 2005 - 5:53 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom - I really like Teardrop&#39;s idea of collecting users&#39; BTK profiles &#40;see <a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/11/181.html?1107135713">here</a>&#41;.  Where should we put them?  Perhaps you don&#39;t want us cluttering up other areas, so I thought I&#39;d give you a heads-up.  Thanks!  -pax<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5459-->
<!--Post: 5554--><!--Time: 1107190067-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5554"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Topsailgrl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Topsailgrl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, January 31, 2005 - 8:47 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom-Does your reference on the first page to Wheaties have anything to do with the name of a certain poster username on a certain kansas newspaper discussion board site? And does it have anything to do with N. Wheatland Pl. in Wichita or N. Wheatland Ave? <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5554-->
<!--Post: 5684--><!--Time: 1107285695-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5684"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Nancydrew<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nancydrew<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 01, 2005 - 11:21 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom - Do a lot of people try to post on the &#34;from BTK&#34; board, and how do you decide which ones to leave up?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5684-->
<!--Post: 5687--><!--Time: 1107286446-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5687"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:webmaster@catchbtk.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Tom_voigt<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tom_voigt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, February 01, 2005 - 11:34 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tippy: If BTK wants to contact me, I&#39;m game. However, I don&#39;t really think he will. <BR> <BR>Wichitan: I haven&#39;t seen an obvious patternwith the drops. Regarding victims, I&#39;m sure he has many more than 7 or 8. <BR> <BR>Marga: BTK was taunting Charlie via the New Mexico stamp. <BR> <BR>Cougar: 1&#41; I have to assume they were coincidences. <BR>        2&#41; WPD never has pressured me. <BR>        3&#41; I have no evidence of that. <BR>        4&#41; Hmmm...get someone drunk who is in the know. <BR> <BR>George: People expect a certain level of nuttiness at a BTK message board, so the kooks don&#39;t have much lasting impact. <BR> <BR>Elsewhere: <i>&#34;BTK: As I stated before, anytime, anywhere, all alone, you and me. Let&#39;s end this story for all to see. From Charlie O.&#34;</i> <BR> <BR>Brazilian: Not that I know of. <BR> <BR>Pax: Maybe one thread in the &#34;Theories&#34; topic? <BR> <BR>Topsailgirl: No. <BR> <BR>Nancydrew: Not many at all.  <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5687-->
<!--Post: 5763--><!--Time: 1107358385-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5763"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tucker<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tucker<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 02, 2005 - 7:33 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom, <BR>I am relatively new to the site, so forgive me if I am being repetitive. <BR>Ever thought about adding more information about yourself on the site?  Perhaps like a Bio section that allows visitors and posters to get to know you a bit more.  I am not talking about deep personal info, but more so of your professional background, how you grew interested in BTK, how long you have been &#34;on the case&#34;, you know, just some backgorund so people can get to know you better.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5763-->
<!--Post: 5791--><!--Time: 1107378278-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5791"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tippy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tippy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, February 02, 2005 - 1:04 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thanks for the answer, Tom.  And thanks for the site.  For some of us living in KS the story of BTK is alarming, even though he is now much older than when he originally started killing.  Other boards are kooky and superficial.  I appreciate the posters here who are serious enough to put forth real theories and ideas.   <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5791-->
<!--Post: 6078--><!--Time: 1107528008-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6078"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lorenap<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lorenap<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 6:40 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom, what made you decide to put the &#34;Satin Sheets&#34; song on the website? If you got it from the interview Susan Peters did with her son, I&#39;m sorry, I think that&#39;s cruel. Correct me if I&#39;m wrong. I thought you were more sensitive than that. It&#39;s just poor taste really. Like I said, I hope I&#39;m wrong. <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6078-->
<!--Post: 6083--><!--Time: 1107530563-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6083"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Chiquitah<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Chiquitah<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 7:22 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Wasn&#39;t that the song that Shirley Vian used to sing to her son? It&#39;s in the interview.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6083-->
<!--Post: 6105--><!--Time: 1107534450-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6105"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Essevi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Essevi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 8:27 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom, do you think that Pat Brown&#39;s POI#1 is a waiste of time?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6105-->
<!--Post: 6106--><!--Time: 1107534503-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6106"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Topsailgrl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Topsailgrl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, February 04, 2005 - 8:28 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom-Are you sticking a hand out to Steve Relford as you are to Charlie? He sure seems to really need someone to do it.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6106-->
<!--Post: 6323--><!--Time: 1107691058-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6323"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tippy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tippy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 06, 2005 - 3:57 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom - I recently heard that BTK might be using the numeral &#34;8&#34;, symbol for &#34;vertical infinity&#34; as his secret correspondence sign and perhaps left it at the scene. <BR> <BR>Have you ever heard that?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 6323-->
<!--Post: 6343--><!--Time: 1107713609-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST6343"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bpb<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bpb<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 06, 2005 - 10:13 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hiya Tom <BR>First of all, thanks for a great and informative site! <BR> <BR>Do you think it&#39;s odd that there are so many unsolved murders ina mid-size town like Wichita during a time period where BTK could very well have been active?  I live in a larger metro area &#40;Twin Cities, MN&#41; and I do not beleive we have nearly as many unsolved murders.  Just wondering if you have any thoughts, and thanks again for the great site. <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
