<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9319"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Tac<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tac<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, February 26, 2005 - 6:53 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom, <BR> <BR>One down one to go.  .  .  I hope you are alright and enjoying the breaking news. Best wishes to you, Ed, Angie, and everyone who contributed to this site. BTK is touchable and catchable.  .  .  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
