<!--Post: 9421--><!--Time: 1109514566-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9421"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Wilmac<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Wilmac<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 27, 2005 - 6:29 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->&#34;and where is fearless leader when we need him.....?&#34; <BR> <BR>My guess is one of two places: <BR>1&#41; In Wichita, because they gave him the heads up that an arrest was imminant, or; <BR>2&#41; punching a wall that he wasn&#39;t around to see all of this go down...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9421-->
<!--Post: 9428--><!--Time: 1109521647-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9428"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lmuncy316<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lmuncy316<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 27, 2005 - 8:27 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom, well what will inevitably happen with this web site and your involvement with it?  It has brought so many different people, with different lifestyles, different ideas, different suggestions, different ethnic groups, and different cultures together for one common goal!  I feel like an idiot now that I reflect on some of my past suggestions, but this web site also made me feel important!  I am ecstatic concerning btk&#39;s capture, but part of me is mourning!  I will miss the activity on this web site if it ends.  One last suggestion, let&#39;s have a celebration of sorts somewhere in Wichita for people of this web site, the community, the victim&#39;s family&#39;s, and yourself.  Everyone wants to come can pay a minimum of X amount of dollars for a plate.  The money can be used to pay for the event and maybe even start college funds for the victim&#39;s children or grandchildren or what have you.BTK dictated how a lot of things unfolded in his victim&#39;s lives.  However, we now have the commanding voice.  We have the ability to dictate what happens from this point forward.  Let&#39;s take advantage of it.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9428-->
<!--Post: 9430--><!--Time: 1109521999-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9430"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Sandy<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Sandy<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 27, 2005 - 8:33 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom I haven&#39;t read all of the post first to make sure I am not repeating another post, because I just haven&#39;t had much time lately.I just thought it is important to know that the btk was turned in by his Daughter, bless her for that. I read her web site, she is a very religious and brave young girl.I won&#39;t be giveing any links to that site however,just because I am sure she has enough to contend with right now.May God bless her for her bravery.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9430-->
<!--Post: 9449--><!--Time: 1109530165-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9449"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Brazilian<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Brazilian<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Sunday, February 27, 2005 - 10:49 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom, I think your work was essential to informe people, to discuss evidences and to let criminals know that its getting more and more difficult to stay at large these days. <BR> <BR>I am very proud to write this to you. <BR> <BR>Congratulations!!! <BR>You are a important part of this!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 9449-->
