<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9772"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:linnieskid@earthlink.net" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Linnieskid<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Linnieskid<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Monday, February 28, 2005 - 3:42 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom: Now, can you tell us if LE gave you any indication of an imminent arrest? Did they think that BTK posted here? Were there any posts that they &#34;watched&#34;? Any insider info you can share? <BR> <BR>Thank you for your hard work and dedication.  This board was moderated with integrity and wasn&#39;t like others that shall remain nameless. <BR>  <BR>I &#40;probably like many others&#41; emailed you with impressions - won&#39;t go so far as to say psychic impressions.  Any of us really hit the target?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
