</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Linnieskid<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 01, 2005 - 3:30 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Would you consider opening a board for the &#34;original night stalker&#34; &#40;not Ramirez&#41;, also known as the Eastside and East Area Rapist?  He raped at least 50 victims and graduated to murder.  The crimes occured about 30 years ago.  He appeared in the mid 70&#39;s and was thought to have disappeared about 1986.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
