<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST10599"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Audreyamw<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Audreyamw<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 05, 2005 - 11:15 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Is that really Tom who posted in the &#34;Messages from BTK&#34; forum, or was that an imposter Tom? <BR> <BR>&#40;Tongue firmly in cheek&#41; <BR> <BR>Welcome back, Tom.  <!--/Text--></td></tr>
