</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 17, 2005 - 2:41 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->TOM&#39;s back??! <BR> <BR>Welcome, back Tom!! We missed you! We&#39;re all anxious to hear about your trip! &#40;unless it&#39;s private&#41;. <BR> <BR>1&#41; So, now that they&#39;ve caught the BLT, what do you make of it? <BR> <BR>2&#41; Is &#34;Denny The Dog Catcher&#34; in the ballpark of the type of character you thought he&#39;d be? &#40;Personally I thought it was Colonel Mustard in the drawing room with the dagger. Wakka-wakka.&#41; <BR> <BR>3&#41; Can you let us know anything about your dealings with the Keystone cops- er- I mean Wichita &#40;or other&#41; police?? <BR> <BR>Victor &amp; &#34;the gang&#34;.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
