</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Tom_voigt<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->5-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 17, 2005 - 10:25 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Victor: <BR> <BR>1&#41; Not sure exactly what you&#39;re asking. <BR> <BR>2&#41; In the last few years, Gary Ridgway and Robert Yates were convicted of serial killings and like Rader, they were married, had kids, long-term jobs and owned homes, so in that sense, I&#39;m not surprised. <BR> <BR>3&#41; No comment<!--/Text--></td></tr>
