</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 18, 2005 - 5:14 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Thanks, Tom. As to my 1st question, &#34; 1&#41; So, now that they&#39;ve caught BTK, what do you make of it?&#34; you answered, <BR> <BR>&#34;Not sure exactly what you&#39;re asking.&#34;. <BR> <BR>It&#39;s not an exact question. I just figured the aim of your whole site all this time has been to &#34;Catch BTK&#34;. And now BTK HAS ACTUALLY BEEN CAUGHT. Figured you&#39;d have some opinion you&#39;d like to share with us. Good, bad. High, low. <BR> <BR>Anything but, &#34;eh, big deal.&#34;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
