<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST11837"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Hmmm<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Hmmm<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->7-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, March 19, 2005 - 8:50 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Tom, <BR>I absolutely respect you for not commenting when you feel it not appropriate.  Please update when you can.   <BR> <BR>1.  If you can answer...is it your opinion that Rader committed more murders? <BR> <BR>2.  Did you post &#34;under the Rader&#34; or something like this on this page as an intro?  I&#39;m maybe having a revisionist memory here...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
